--
--   **Context.** Segmented inverse (S2): exact structure of the resampling system (report L1, L2, L4, L8 tail)
--
--   Entries of `N = I + E` are `eEx s t α l h = e^{-πα² X/s²}`, `X = eKz s t l h`.
